description
  <b><i>PLEASE BE MINDFUL THAT THIS GENERATOR MAY CAUSE SOME DEVICES TO CRASH DUE TO ITS LARGE SELECTION OF NAMES!</i></b> If you are using a mobile phone or a low-end device, please use this website cautiously and carefully. It is recommended to generate only one name at a time to prevent the risk of crashing.<br><br>This name generator takes names from several sources piled up by me since the fall of 2021, including multiple text files, mounds of repositories on Github and even some obscure places like the late Mithril and Mages (rest in peace). This generator contains <b>1,037,351 first names</b>, and <b>3,122,089 last names</b>, and thus, if you do not count entries that will have two last names, there are a whopping <i><b>3.2 TRILLION NAME COMBINATIONS</i></b> that you can use for any project of your liking!<br><br>This generator was made by <a href\="https://2mhc.straw.page/">TooManyHungryCats</a> (a.k.a. Cal), a furry artist and blank VHS collector from Pennsylvania, on October 7, 2024.
  $output = <p>[this.joinItems("</p><p>")]</p>
  // Don't remove the line above! It uses the special "$output" property to join and format your description as HTML paragraphs.
